{{!
    @template tool_vae/organisation_site

    The configuration of the scheme: the records (a box, or the table and the sentence on the number of plans), the rights
    (the grid of the actors, the actors without an account, the rights of the plugin), the cohorts (a box, the word "none",
    or the table) and the settings. On logical lines: a comment carries each line break of the template, so that no space
    is drawn where the old code wrote none.

    Every text comes from the context, worded by tool_vae\output\organisation_site. The template holds no logic beyond its
    sections. Every text is escaped (double braces). Keys placed as they are (triple braces): noticehtml, a box drawn by
    tool_vae/organisation_notice (or empty); tablehtml, actorshtml, capabilitieshtml and settingshtml, tables drawn by
    tool_vae/table (or empty).

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * ficheheading, powersheading, rolesatsite, actorsheading, actorsintro, capabilitiesheading, cohortsheading,
      settingsheading - string, the headings and the sentences under them
    * fiches - {noticehtml, tablehtml, note}: note null or {label}
    * actorshtml, capabilitieshtml, settingshtml - string, HTML: the tables
    * notes - null, or {items}: each {name, note}, an actor without an account
    * cohorts - {noticehtml, none, tablehtml}: none null or {label}

    Example context (json):
    {
        "ficheheading": "Records",
        "fiches": {"noticehtml": "", "tablehtml": "<table class=\"generaltable\"><tbody><tr><td>RNCP100</td></tr></tbody></table>",
            "note": {"label": "The number of plans counts the drafts."} },
        "powersheading": "Rights",
        "rolesatsite": "Roles given at the level of the site.",
        "actorsheading": "Actors",
        "actorsintro": "Who does what.",
        "actorshtml": "<table class=\"generaltable\"><tbody><tr><td>Vaeiste</td></tr></tbody></table>",
        "notes": {"items": [{"name": "Jury", "note": "Has no account."}]},
        "capabilitiesheading": "Rights of the plugin",
        "capabilitieshtml": "<table class=\"generaltable\"><tbody><tr><td>tool/vae:viewany</td></tr></tbody></table>",
        "cohortsheading": "Cohorts",
        "cohorts": {"noticehtml": "", "none": {"label": "none"}, "tablehtml": ""},
        "settingsheading": "Settings",
        "settingshtml": "<table class=\"generaltable\"><tbody><tr><td>Open</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    }
}}
<h3>{{ficheheading}}</h3>{{#fiches}}{{{noticehtml}}}{{{tablehtml}}}{{!
}}{{#note}}<p class="text-muted small">{{label}}</p>{{/note}}{{/fiches}}{{!
}}<h3>{{powersheading}}</h3><p class="text-muted small">{{rolesatsite}}</p>{{!
}}<h4>{{actorsheading}}</h4><p class="text-muted small">{{actorsintro}}</p>{{{actorshtml}}}{{!
}}{{#notes}}<ul class="list-unstyled small">{{#items}}<li><strong>{{name}}</strong> - {{note}}</li>{{/items}}</ul>{{/notes}}{{!
}}<h4>{{capabilitiesheading}}</h4>{{{capabilitieshtml}}}{{!
}}<h3>{{cohortsheading}}</h3>{{#cohorts}}{{{noticehtml}}}{{#none}}<p>{{label}}</p>{{/none}}{{{tablehtml}}}{{/cohorts}}{{!
}}<h3>{{settingsheading}}</h3>{{{settingshtml}}}
